      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know... that just sounds like something people say to make it feel better, but it doesnt change the math of it. the city doesnt care if i'm a glitch or not, it just keeps spinning. it feels like there’s this huge relief in the idea that i could just let go and let the city take over. like, if i stopped trying so hard to be \"someone\" and just let myself fade into the background, wouldn't that just be more natural? it seems more peaceful than fighting to stay relevant in a place that doesn't even see me.",
